---
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Affiliate Disclosure — Casilla"
  description="How Casilla makes money, what that does and does not influence, and how to use the site if you would rather not send us any commission at all."
>
  <h1 class="text-[32px] sm:text-[38px]">Affiliate disclosure</h1>

  <Prose>
    <p class="mt-5">
      Casilla earns commission. When you follow a <strong>Visit site</strong> link and go on
      to register or deposit, the casino may pay us a share of what it earns from you, or a
      one-off fee for the referral. It costs you nothing extra and it does not change the
      terms you are offered.
    </p>

    <h2>What commission does not affect</h2>
    <p>
      The order of the ranking. Position is calculated from the aggregated scores described
      in <a href="/methodology/">how we rate</a>, and no casino can buy a higher place, a
      badge, or a mention. There is no paid placement on this site in any form.
    </p>
    <p>
      The written verdicts. We list casinos we would not personally use and say so on their
      pages, including where they earn us money.
    </p>

    <h2>What it does affect, honestly</h2>
    <p>
      Which casinos exist here at all. A site that reviews nothing but operators with no
      affiliate programme would not survive, so commercial reality shapes the shortlist even
      though it does not shape the ordering within it. You should read this site, and every
      site like it, with that in mind.
    </p>

    <h2>If you would rather not</h2>
    <p>
      Nothing here requires you to use our links. Every casino's own address is visible on
      its page, and typing it into your browser directly costs us the commission and costs
      you nothing. We would rather you use the site and trust it than use our links and not.
    </p>
  </Prose>
</Base>
